\description{
A lightweight, package-private registry so that domain packages can advertise
the file readers/writers and named operations they provide without PhysioExperiment
depending on them. Downstream packages call the \verb{register*()} verbs from their
own \code{.onLoad()} (with \code{overwrite = TRUE}, so re-loading a session is
idempotent); any package discovers or dispatches through \verb{available*()} and
\verb{get*()}.
